ing"><p data-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"252">Preparar dados para impress=C3=A3=
o em uma <strong data-start=3D"37" data-end=3D"59">impressora t=C3=A9rmica<=
/strong> em Java n=C3=A3o =C3=A9 apenas =E2=80=9Cmandar texto=E2=80=9D =E2=
=80=94 envolve formatar o conte=C3=BAdo para que ele seja <strong data-star=
t=3D"144" data-end=3D"170">leg=C3=ADvel e bem alinhado</strong> na largura =
limitada do papel, usando comandos espec=C3=ADficos (geralmente ESC/POS).</=
p>
<p data-start=3D"254" data-end=3D"332">Vou te explicar o processo passo a p=
asso e depois te dou um exemplo funcional.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"334" data-end=3D"337">
<h2 data-start=3D"339" data-end=3D"376"><strong data-start=3D"342" data-end=
=3D"376">1. Entender a largura do papel</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"377" data-end=3D"449">A maioria das impressoras t=C3=A9rmi=
cas usa rolo de <strong data-start=3D"424" data-end=3D"433">58 mm</strong> =
ou <strong data-start=3D"437" data-end=3D"446">80 mm</strong>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"450" data-end=3D"618">
<li data-start=3D"450" data-end=3D"501">
<p data-start=3D"452" data-end=3D"501">58 mm =E2=86=92 ~32 caracteres por l=
inha (fonte normal)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"502" data-end=3D"618">
<p data-start=3D"504" data-end=3D"618">80 mm =E2=86=92 ~48 caracteres por l=
inha (fonte normal)<br data-start=3D"551" data-end=3D"554">
Voc=C3=AA precisa saber essa largura para alinhar texto corretamente.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"620" data-end=3D"623">
<h2 data-start=3D"625" data-end=3D"660"><strong data-start=3D"628" data-end=
=3D"660">2. Usar o padr=C3=A3o de comandos</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"661" data-end=3D"774">A maioria das impressoras t=C3=A9rmi=
cas usa <strong data-start=3D"700" data-end=3D"711">ESC/POS</strong>, um co=
njunto de comandos criado pela Epson.<br data-start=3D"755" data-end=3D"758=
">
Comandos comuns:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"775" data-end=3D"1073">
<li data-start=3D"775" data-end=3D"814">
<p data-start=3D"777" data-end=3D"814"><code data-start=3D"777" data-end=3D=
"786">\x1B@\n</code> =E2=86=92 inicializa a impressora</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"815" data-end=3D"846">
<p data-start=3D"817" data-end=3D"846"><code data-start=3D"817" data-end=3D=
"828">\x1B!\x00</code> =E2=86=92 estilo normal</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"847" data-end=3D"881">
<p data-start=3D"849" data-end=3D"881"><code data-start=3D"849" data-end=3D=
"860">\x1B!\x08</code> =E2=86=92 texto em negrito</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"882" data-end=3D"919">
<p data-start=3D"884" data-end=3D"919"><code data-start=3D"884" data-end=3D=
"895">\x1B!\x10</code> =E2=86=92 texto duplo tamanho</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"920" data-end=3D"951">
<p data-start=3D"922" data-end=3D"951"><code data-start=3D"922" data-end=3D=
"933">\x1B!\x01</code> =E2=86=92 texto pequeno</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"952" data-end=3D"992">
<p data-start=3D"954" data-end=3D"992"><code data-start=3D"954" data-end=3D=
"965">\x1BD\x01</code> =E2=86=92 alinhamento =C3=A0 esquerda</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"993" data-end=3D"1035">
<p data-start=3D"995" data-end=3D"1035"><code data-start=3D"995" data-end=
=3D"1006">\x1BD\x02</code> =E2=86=92 alinhamento centralizado</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1036" data-end=3D"1073">
<p data-start=3D"1038" data-end=3D"1073"><code data-start=3D"1038" data-end=
=3D"1049">\x1BD\x03</code> =E2=86=92 alinhamento =C3=A0 direita</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1075" data-end=3D"1078">
<h2 data-start=3D"1080" data-end=3D"1109"><strong data-start=3D"1083" data-=
end=3D"1109">3. Estruturar os dados</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1110" data-end=3D"1170">Antes de enviar para a impressora,=
 monte a string formatada:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1171" data-end=3D"1324">
<li data-start=3D"1171" data-end=3D"1213">
<p data-start=3D"1173" data-end=3D"1213">Cabe=C3=A7alho (nome da loja, CNPJ=
, endere=C3=A7o)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1214" data-end=3D"1231">
<p data-start=3D"1216" data-end=3D"1231">T=C3=ADtulo da venda</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1232" data-end=3D"1277">
<p data-start=3D"1234" data-end=3D"1277">Lista de produtos (nome, quantidad=
e, pre=C3=A7o)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1278" data-end=3D"1307">
<p data-start=3D"1280" data-end=3D"1307">Totais e forma de pagamento</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1308" data-end=3D"1324">
<p data-start=3D"1310" data-end=3D"1324">Mensagem final</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1326" data-end=3D"1329">
<h2 data-start=3D"1331" data-end=3D"1364"><strong data-start=3D"1334" data-=
end=3D"1364">4. Envio para a impressora</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1365" data-end=3D"1380">Voc=C3=AA pode usar:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1381" data-end=3D"1749">
<li data-start=3D"1381" data-end=3D"1471">
<p data-start=3D"1383" data-end=3D"1471"><strong data-start=3D"1383" data-e=
nd=3D"1405">Java Print Service</strong> (<code data-start=3D"1407" data-end=
=3D"1420">javax.print</code>) =E2=86=92 envia dados para impressoras locais=
 ou de rede.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1472" data-end=3D"1590">
<p data-start=3D"1474" data-end=3D"1590"><strong data-start=3D"1474" data-e=
nd=3D"1506">Conex=C3=A3o serial/USB/Bluetooth</strong> =E2=86=92 usando bib=
liotecas como <code data-start=3D"1533" data-end=3D"1545">javax.comm</code>=
, <code data-start=3D"1547" data-end=3D"1553">RXTX</code> ou sockets (em im=
pressoras de rede).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1591" data-end=3D"1749">
<p data-start=3D"1593" data-end=3D"1749"><strong data-start=3D"1593" data-e=
nd=3D"1626">Bibliotecas ESC/POS para Java</strong> =E2=86=92 como <a data-s=
tart=3D"1634" data-end=3D"1699" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D""=
 href=3D"https://github.com/anastaciocintra/escpos-coffee">escpos-coffee</a=
> (mais simples para alinhar e aplicar formata=C3=A7=C3=A3o).</p>
</li>
</ul>
