end=3D"3863">6. Dicas importantes</strong></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"3864" data-end=3D"4189">
<li data-start=3D"3864" data-end=3D"3920">
<p data-start=3D"3866" data-end=3D"3920">Sempre teste no <strong data-start=
=3D"3882" data-end=3D"3894">emulador</strong> ou com a impressora real.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3921" data-end=3D"3997">
<p data-start=3D"3923" data-end=3D"3997">Use <code data-start=3D"3927" data=
-end=3D"3934">CP437</code> ou <code data-start=3D"3938" data-end=3D"3945">C=
P850</code> para acentua=C3=A7=C3=A3o correta (dependendo da impressora).</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3998" data-end=3D"4093">
<p data-start=3D"4000" data-end=3D"4093">Para QR Code, c=C3=B3digos de barr=
as e gr=C3=A1ficos, voc=C3=AA precisa enviar comandos ESC/POS espec=C3=ADfi=
cos.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4094" data-end=3D"4189">
<p data-start=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4189">Se for Bluetooth/USB, a porta pode=
 ser algo como <code data-start=3D"4145" data-end=3D"4153">"COM3"</code>, <=
code data-start=3D"4155" data-end=3D"4171">"/dev/ttyUSB0"</code> ou via soc=
ket IP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
