<p data-start=3D"2083" data-end=3D"2125"><strong data-start=3D"2083" data-e=
nd=3D"2123">O que s=C3=A3o esses <code data-start=3D"2101" data-end=3D"2109=
">\u001B</code> e <code data-start=3D"2112" data-end=3D"2120">\u001D</code>=
?</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2126" data-end=3D"2294">
<li data-start=3D"2126" data-end=3D"2218">
<p data-start=3D"2128" data-end=3D"2218"><code data-start=3D"2128" data-end=
=3D"2136">\u001B</code> =C3=A9 o caractere <strong data-start=3D"2151" data=
-end=3D"2158">ESC</strong> (c=C3=B3digo 27 decimal), usado para iniciar com=
andos ESC/POS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2219" data-end=3D"2294">
<p data-start=3D"2221" data-end=3D"2294"><code data-start=3D"2221" data-end=
=3D"2229">\u001D</code> =C3=A9 o caractere <strong data-start=3D"2244" data=
-end=3D"2250">GS</strong> (Group Separator), outro comando ESC/POS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2296" data-end=3D"2321"><strong data-start=3D"2296" data-e=
nd=3D"2321">Comandos usados aqui:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2536">
<li data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2366">
<p data-start=3D"2324" data-end=3D"2366"><code data-start=3D"2324" data-end=
=3D"2331">ESC @</code> =E2=86=92 inicializa/reset a impressora.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2367" data-end=3D"2506">
<p data-start=3D"2369" data-end=3D"2433"><code data-start=3D"2369" data-end=
=3D"2378">ESC ! n</code> =E2=86=92 define estilo de texto (<code data-start=
=3D"2405" data-end=3D"2408">n</code> muda tamanho/negrito).</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2438" data-end=3D"2506">
<li data-start=3D"2438" data-end=3D"2473">
<p data-start=3D"2440" data-end=3D"2473"><code data-start=3D"2440" data-end=
=3D"2448">\u0010</code> =E2=86=92 texto duplo tamanho.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2478" data-end=3D"2506">
<p data-start=3D"2480" data-end=3D"2506"><code data-start=3D"2480" data-end=
=3D"2488">\u0000</code> =E2=86=92 texto normal.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2507" data-end=3D"2536">
<p data-start=3D"2509" data-end=3D"2536"><code data-start=3D"2509" data-end=
=3D"2517">GS V 0</code> =E2=86=92 corta o papel.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2538" data-end=3D"2582">O resto do conte=C3=BAdo s=C3=A3o =
as linhas do recibo.</p>
